91cd\u7533\u6b22\u8fce\u4e2d\u8d44\u4f01\u4e1a\u8d74\u5370\u5c3c\u6295\u8d44\u5408\u4f5c\uff0c\u5e0c\u671b\u5370\u5c3c\u4e3a\u6b64\u63d0\u4f9b\u516c\u5e73\u516c\u6b63\u8425\u5546\u73af\u5883\u3002\u4e2d\u5370\u5c3c\u5408\u4f5c\u4e0d\u9488\u5bf9\u7b2c\u4e09\u65b9\uff0c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u5e94\u53d7\u7b2c\u4e09\u65b9\u5e72\u6270\u3002\u53cc\u65b9\u8981\u5e26\u5934\u634d\u536b\u591a\u8fb9\u8d38\u6613\u4f53\u5236\uff0c", "title_en": "Wang Yi: Appreciates Indonesia's reaffirmation of welcoming Chinese enterprises to invest and cooperate in Indonesia", "summary_en": "According to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs website, on July 18, Wang Yi, member of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee and Foreign Minister, met in Shanghai with Airlangga Hartarto, Indonesia's Coordinating Minister for Economic Affairs, who was attending the World Artificial Intelligence Conference. Wang Yi emphasized that under the strategic guidance of the two heads of state, positive progress has been made in building a China-Indonesia community with a shared future in recent years. As representatives of the Global South and emerging economies, China and Indonesia share similar development goals, broad common interests, and obvious complementary advantages. Both sides should strengthen the alignment of development strategies, move in the same direction, interact positively, eliminate interference, maintain focus, continuously deepen mutually beneficial cooperation in various fields, and serve as a model for the Global South in unity, mutual assistance, and joint self-reliance. China appreciates the Coordinating Minister's reaffirmation of welcoming Chinese enterprises to invest and cooperate in Indonesia and hopes Indonesia will provide a fair and equitable business environment. China-Indonesia cooperation is not targeted at any third party and should not be interfered with by any third party. Both sides should take the lead in defending the multilateral trading system."}, {"title": "Tourism appeal adds to Australia\u2019s edge in drawing mainland Chinese, Hong Kong homebuyers", "summary": "Australia\u2019s tourism appeal and property price correction are reinforcing the case for mainland Chinese and Hong Kong investors to buy homes down under, according to agents.\nEducation had long been a major draw for many mainland and Hong Kong buyers, but the country\u2019s tourist attractions, relaxed lifestyle and moderating property prices in major cities such as Sydney and Melbourne were burnishing its appeal as a top investment destination, agents said.\n\u201cWho wouldn\u2019t like to look out from their...", "url": "https://www.scmp.com/business/article/3360988/tourism-appeal-adds-australias-edge-drawing-mainland-chinese-hong-kong-homebuyers?utm_source=rss_feed", "time": "2026-07-19T01:00:10+00:00", "theme": "markets", "source": "news_rss", "source_name": "SCMP - Business", "source_lang": "en", "source_tier": "global_wire", "wire_important": false, "importance_score": 62, "intelligence_score": 72, "importance": "medium", "importance_reasons": ["tier-1 China wire", "tier-1 China macro term", "market-sensitive term", "dashboard core theme"], "channels": ["property"], "tickers": ["512200.SS"], "ticker_reasons": {"512200.SS": "property"}, "related_tickers": [{"ticker": "512200.SS", "reason": "property"}]}, {"title": "IPO\u6392\u961f\u5238\u5546\u201c\u534a\u5e74\u8003\u201d\uff01\u9996\u4efd\u6210\u7ee9\u5355\u51fa\u7089\uff0c\u51c0\u5229\u5927\u589e\u8d8570%", "summary": "", "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/zqgd/2026-07-19/doc-iniihuvk1164570.shtml", "time": "2026-07-19", "theme": "markets", "source": "cn_news_page", "source_name": "\u65b0\u6d6a\u8d22\u7ecf\u80a1\u7968", "source_lang": "zh", "source_tier": "china_native", "wire_important": false, "importance_score": 54, "intelligence_score": 72, "importance": "medium", "importance_reasons": ["native Chinese financial source", "dashboard core theme"], "channels": ["markets"], "tickers": ["512880.SS"], "t